OL,3,C'My body isn't quite ready': Keely
OL,4,Cpulls out of Zurich Diamond League
OL,6,FKeely Hodgkinson has withdrawn from
OL,7,Fthe Diamond League meeting in Zurich,
OL,8,Fruling her out of a heavily
OL,9,Fanticipated 800 metres showdown,
OL,10,Fbecause her "body is not quite ready".
OL,12,FThe 24-year-old athlete confirmed she
OL,13,Fwill skip the event, admitting she has
OL,14,Fnot fully recovered following her
OL,15,Frecent campaign at the European
OL,16,FChampionships.
OL,18,FIn a short statement, Hodgkinson said:
OL,19,F"Unfortunately the body isn't quite
OL,20,Fready to race again after the European
OL,21,FChampionships.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/4
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
