FL,315,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F314A1787935777
OL,3,C'My body isn't quite ready': Keely
OL,4,Cpulls out of Zurich Diamond League
OL,6,F"We've made the decision to skip this
OL,7,Frace and get ready for the next one,
OL,8,Fsad to miss it, hopefully see you next
OL,9,Fyear!"
OL,11,FHodgkinson, who is from Atherton,
OL,12,FGreater Manchester, was looking
OL,13,Fforward to the prospect of taking on a
OL,14,Fworld-class field in Zurich.
OL,16,FSpeaking earlier this month in
OL,17,FBirmingham, she said: "I signed myself
OL,18,Fup for Zurich because I knew everyone
OL,19,Fwas in it but me.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/4
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,315,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F314A1787935777
OL,3,C'My body isn't quite ready': Keely
OL,4,Cpulls out of Zurich Diamond League
OL,6,F"I want to be in with the best and I
OL,7,Fthink that's going to bring out the
OL,8,Fbest in me."
OL,10,FThe event was set to see Hodgkinson
OL,11,Fface off again with Swiss rival Audrey
OL,12,FWerro, who beat her to European gold
OL,13,Fearlier this month, as well as
OL,14,Fcompatriot and Commonwealth Games 800m
OL,15,Fchampion Georgia Hunter Bell.
OL,17,FThe original field also featured
OL,18,FEuropean bronze medallist Femke
OL,19,FBroeders-Bol and world champion Lilian
OL,20,FOdira.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/4
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
