PN,31404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F314A1787935777
OL,3,C'My body isn't quite ready': Keely
OL,4,Cpulls out of Zurich Diamond League
OL,6,FHowever, Odira also pulled out of the
OL,7,Fmeeting, citing medical advice in a
OL,8,Fstatement posted to Instagram.
OL,10,FHodgkinson's withdrawal comes after a
OL,11,Fchallenging two years marked by
OL,12,Frepeated physical setbacks.
OL,14,FThe runner struggled with a persistent
OL,15,Fhamstring issue throughout 2025 and
OL,16,Fsuffered a further setback in June
OL,17,Fwhen she sustained a knee injury in a
OL,18,Ffreak accident.
